# Retain only Person's familyName occurrence and its original identifiers/types.
# ADD sh:datatype xsd:string as an EXPLICIT LOCAL TEST ASSUMPTION, absent in source.
# Do not add min/max cardinalities. Exclude other fields and ontology imports here,
# not from original.ttl. Never publish this as the unmodified webcor 0.0.2 profile.
@prefix webcor: <https://iri.suomi.fi/model/webcor/> .
@prefix eu-core: <https://iri.suomi.fi/model/eu-core/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
<urn:metatietovaranto:test:webcor-family-name> a owl:Ontology .
webcor:Person a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass eu-core:Person ; sh:property webcor:familyName .
webcor:familyName a sh:PropertyShape, owl:DatatypeProperty ; sh:path eu-core:familyName ; sh:datatype xsd:string .
